            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Aimee Sherrod"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I grew up on sweet spaghetti sauce and this recipe is great! I added the butter but it didn't need it so I will omit next time. I didn't measure the sugar, I'm pretty sure I put far more than it called for though. If you aren't used to a sweet sauce this may not be for you. If you do, them this is the one you're looking for!",
            "datePublished": "2022-01-28T02:15:38.579Z"
